(MASTER CLOUD SERVICES AND LEVEL AGREEMENT \(SLA\)) Tj T*
(Contract Reference: MSA-2026-CLOUD-9941. Effective Date: October 1, 2026.) Tj T*
(Parties: Apex Cloud Infrastructure LLC \('Provider'\) and Horizon Global Corp \('Customer'\).) Tj T*
(Section 1: Scope of Managed Cloud Services and Deliverables) Tj T*
(Provider agrees to provision and maintain multi-region Kubernetes clusters,) Tj T*
(database replication, and automated CI/CD deployment pipelines as defined in Exhibit A.) Tj T*
(Section 2: Service Level Availability and Downtime Credits) Tj T*
(Provider covenants that Monthly Uptime Percentage shall equal or exceed 99.95%.) Tj T*
(Monthly Uptime % = \(\(Total Minutes in Month - Downtime Minutes\) / Total Minutes\) * 100) Tj T*
(If Provider fails to maintain the Uptime Percentage, Customer receives service credits:) Tj T*
(- 99.0% to < 99.95%: 15% credit of Monthly Base Fee) Tj T*
(- 95.0% to < 99.0%: 30% credit of Monthly Base Fee) Tj T*
(- < 95.0%: 100% credit of Monthly Base Fee) Tj T*
(Section 3: Mutual Indemnification and Limitation of Liability) Tj T*
(Neither party shall be liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages.) Tj T*
(Maximum aggregate liability is capped at fees paid by Customer in preceding 12 months.) Tj T*
(Section 4: Governing Law and Dispute Jurisdiction) Tj T*
(This Agreement is governed by the laws of the State of Delaware without reference to conflicts of law.) Tj T*
(IN WITNESS WHEREOF, authorized representatives have executed this Agreement.) Tj T*
(Apex Cloud Infrastructure LLC: [Authorized Officer Signature] Date: Oct 1, 2026) Tj T*
(Horizon Global Corp: [Chief Information Officer Signature] Date: Oct 1, 2026) Tj T*
